            [f"{len(q):,} of those sell in two or more world regions (International or Global). {len(q) - len(new)} are already on your Private sheet."],
            [f"{len(new)} are NEW candidates: {pr['High']} High priority, {pr['Medium']} Medium. {inside} are in the eight sectors your sheet already covers; {len(new) - inside} are in sectors it does not cover. They are listed on the 'New Candidates' tab in the usual format."],
            [f"A further {len(tbc)} pass the capacity and fit test but are shown as Domestic or Regional only by inference ('Reach To Confirm' tab). On your Private sheet, a web check moved about half of such brands to International."], [],
