            ['Theme Screen: 26 themes cutting across sectors. For each: how many private companies, how much they raised, the share that raised money in the last 12 months (momentum), how many pass the test, the funding trend and who in the category already buys F1 (web research of 16 Nov 2026), restrictions, and what to do.'],
            ['Verdicts: Priority now / Core / Add now = money, fit and proven F1 buyers. Build next / Add next = money and growth, F1 buying only starting. Watch-list = funding is booming but companies are pre-revenue, restricted, or not yet buying sport.'], [],
